[E-REWRITE-TARGET] Error: `rewrite … at … in` needs a local name after `at`
   ╭─[ reject/rewrite-at-target.sw:5:16 ]
   │
 5 │   rewrite e at Nat.addSucc n k in Nat.addSucc m k
   │                ───────┬───────  
   │                       ╰───────── this isn't a local name, so there is nothing to give the new type for the rest of the proof
